"""orgxray v2 — angrepsflate + secret-historikk + person-targeting for offentlige orgs.

v2 endringer vs v1 (red-team funn):
  - Dekning: --strategy updated|oldest|all|random|big  (v1: kun top-8 newest)
  - Person-targeting: `people` -> git shortlog -> commit-forfattere for pitch
  - Triage: severity-score, test-fixture FP-filter, dedup
  - Incrementell: hopper over repos som allerede er skannet på samme HEAD
  - Rate-limit bevisst + parallelle kloner
  - Multi-source stub: sjekker gitlab.com for org-navnet

Kommandoer:
  orgxray discover                     Sjekk candidate-orgs + rapporter nye
  orgxray stats <org>                  Full repo-inventar (alder, språk, størrelse)
  orgxray scan <org> [--strategy S] [--top N]
  orgxray history <org> [--strategy S] [--top N]
  orgxray people <org> [--repo R]      Commit-forfattere -> pitch-targets
  orgxray triage [org|rapport.json]    Severity + FP-filter + LIVE/HIST
  orgxray report [org] [--html]        Aggreger alt, valgfri HTML-rapport
  orgxray watch [org]                  Rescan kun repos med nye commits
  orgxray deep <org|sti> [--json]      Dyp-scan: kodede/skjulte secrets
  orgxray members <org> [--top N] [--committers] [--history] [--rescan]
                                     Medlem-repos + gists (employee-leaks);
                                     --history: full historikk (ikke bare HEAD)
  orgxray shortlist [org]              Kun LIVE+high rapportverdige funn
  orgxray disclose <org> [--owner L] [--repo R]   Generer disclosure-drafts
  orgxray orgs                         Kjente orger

Data: ~/arkiv/org-xray/<org>/ (repos, reports, people.json)
"""
